raph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d1c24aa5-8f54-4762-88b3-6f5fc498438b\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-3f73a3f3-3599-4987-a937-860d8ce05127\">부실우려차주. 신청후. 사업을 계속 유지 가능할까요?</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-fa42a8a7-28c4-4fcb-93a6-beb951cf3a51\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-4859a6a1-ccc1-405c-8bfd-8ed94dd116d9\">통장사용은 가능할까요?</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1a61ec0f-1c13-4220-bc3f-8a0fea86612c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-2e14a917-e39a-451d-b4c2-fa7e1234377a\">압류가 들어 올까바 걱정입니다 </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-53f3e6dc-ff1c-4673-9cf5-b783db746c4c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-c9caa69a-02ea-404c-a719-b1fcf93a29f0\">통장으로 들어오는돈이 거의. 인건비다 보니 걱정입니다</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e6a70589-b087-40a9-890b-44a50143fc09\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-ddca6eda-9ad8-4832-acbb-21e3ec96fb5b\">개인회생은.  생각이 없읍니다</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-419764f0-1cc7-4e55-8db7-6683ace0061c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-c1c1906e-f579-4237-9120-d6fd876c1ce9\">조언좀 부탁드립니다</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <script type=\"text/data\" class=\"__se_module_data\" data-module-v2='{\"type\": \"v2_text\", \"id\": \"SE-940dc362-7b4c-435a-903c-9b030edb2f28\", \"data\": {\"ctype\": \"text\"  }}'></script>\n                </div>    </div>\n</div>\n",
